{"html":"\r\n  \u003cheader\u003e\r\n    \u003cdiv class=\"container navigation\"\u003e\r\n      \u003ca class=\"brand\" href=\"index.html\"\u003e\r\n        \u003cspan class=\"brand-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003eSRA\u003c/span\u003e\r\n        \u003cspan\u003e\r\n          \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Ride Advisor\u003c/strong\u003e\r\n          \u003csmall\u003eDrive with clarity\u003c/small\u003e\r\n        \u003c/span\u003e\r\n      \u003c/a\u003e\r\n\r\n      \u003cnav aria-label=\"Quick links\"\u003e\r\n        \u003ca href=\"index.html\"\u003eHome\u003c/a\u003e\r\n        \u003ca href=\"index.html#calculator\"\u003eFare Calculator\u003c/a\u003e\r\n        \u003ca href=\"index.html#privacy\"\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e\r\n      \u003c/nav\u003e\r\n    \u003c/div\u003e\r\n  \u003c/header\u003e\r\n\r\n  \u003cmain\u003e\r\n    \u003csection class=\"hero-guide\"\u003e\r\n      \u003cdiv class=\"container\"\u003e\r\n        \u003cp class=\"eyebrow\"\u003eTerms \u0026amp; Account Operations\u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003ch1\u003eTerms \u0026amp; Conditions: \u003cspan\u003eAccount Deletion\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\r\n        \u003cp class=\"lead\"\u003e\r\n          Review our terms regarding user data erasure, followed by the exact steps to delete your account directly inside the Smart Ride Advisor mobile application.\r\n        \u003c/p\u003e\r\n      \u003c/div\u003e\r\n    \u003c/section\u003e\r\n\r\n    \u003csection\u003e\r\n      \u003cdiv class=\"container\"\u003e\r\n        \u003c!-- Terms and Conditions Summary --\u003e\r\n        \u003cdiv class=\"card\"\u003e\r\n          \u003ch2 style=\"margin-top: 0; font-size: 22px; color: var(--gold);\"\u003eTerms \u0026amp; Conditions of Account Deletion\u003c/h2\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\r\n            By initiating an account deletion request through the Smart Ride Advisor app, you agree to the following terms:\r\n          \u003c/p\u003e\r\n          \u003cdiv class=\"terms-box\"\u003e\r\n            \u003ch4\u003eKey Terms:\u003c/h4\u003e\r\n            \u003cul\u003e\r\n              \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIrreversibility:\u003c/strong\u003e Deleting your account is instantaneous and permanent. You will not be able to reactivate or restore previous calculation logs or customized settings.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n              \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImmediate Service Termination:\u003c/strong\u003e Access to background OCR assistance, fare calculations, and rate guidance will terminate immediately upon confirmation.\u003c/li\u003e\r\n              \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnline deletion:\u003c/strong\u003e The website deletion flow removes the Firebase Authentication account and the UID-keyed driver profile and ride calculation records. Other app storage paths must be added to the deletion process if the Android app stores data elsewhere.\u003c/li\u003e\n              \u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIndependent Ecosystem:\u003c/strong\u003e Deleting your Smart Ride Advisor account has zero impact on your third-party ride-hailing app accounts (e.g., inDrive).\u003c/li\u003e\r\n            \u003c/ul\u003e\r\n          \u003c/div\u003e\r\n        \u003c/div\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003cdiv class=\"warning-box\"\u003e\r\n          \u003ch3\u003e\r\n            \u003csvg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\u003e\r\n              \u003cpath d=\"M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\r\n              \u003cline x1=\"12\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"13\"\u003e\u003c/line\u003e\r\n              \u003cline x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"\u003e\u003c/line\u003e\r\n            \u003c/svg\u003e\r\n            Permanent \u0026amp; Irreversible Action\r\n          \u003c/h3\u003e\r\n          \u003cp\u003e\r\n            Once confirmed, your account records cannot be recovered. If you wish to use the service again, you will be required to create a new profile from scratch.\r\n          \u003c/p\u003e\r\n        \u003c/div\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003ch2 style=\"letter-spacing: -.03em; margin-bottom: 24px;\"\u003eFollow These Steps to Delete Your Account\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"card\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003ch3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px\"\u003eDelete online\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cp style=\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\"\u003eSign in with email and password, then confirm permanent deletion. Phone-only users can delete in the signed-in app or contact support.\u003c/p\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003ca class=\"button\" href=\"delete-account.html\"\u003eOpen account deletion\u003c/a\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n\n        \u003cdiv class=\"steps-container\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"step-item\"\u003e\r\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-number\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\r\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-content\"\u003e\r\n              \u003ch3\u003eLog in to the Smart Ride Advisor App\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n              \u003cp\u003eLaunch the SRA application on your Android phone and sign in with your phone number or email credentials.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n              \u003cspan class=\"step-badge\"\u003eStep 1: Authenticated\u003c/span\u003e\r\n            \u003c/div\u003e\r\n          \u003c/div\u003e\r\n\r\n          \u003cdiv class=\"step-item\"\u003e\r\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-number\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\r\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-content\"\u003e\r\n              \u003ch3\u003eGo to Your Driver Profile Screen\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n              \u003cp\u003eTap your \u003cstrong\u003eProfile Avatar\u003c/strong\u003e in the top header, or select \u003cstrong\u003eProfile\u003c/strong\u003e from the bottom navigation bar.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n              \u003cspan class=\"step-badge\"\u003eStep 2: Profile Screen\u003c/span\u003e\r\n            \u003c/div\u003e\r\n          \u003c/div\u003e\r\n\r\n          \u003cdiv class=\"step-item\"\u003e\r\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-number\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\r\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-content\"\u003e\r\n              \u003ch3\u003eScroll Down and Tap \"Delete Account\"\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n              \u003cp\u003eScroll down to the bottom of the driver profile screen past your vehicle settings, and tap the red \u003cstrong\u003eDelete account\u003c/strong\u003e button.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n              \u003cspan class=\"step-badge\"\u003eStep 3: Tap Red Button\u003c/span\u003e\r\n            \u003c/div\u003e\r\n          \u003c/div\u003e\r\n\r\n          \u003cdiv class=\"step-item\"\u003e\r\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-number\"\u003e4\u003c/div\u003e\r\n            \u003cdiv class=\"step-content\"\u003e\r\n              \u003ch3\u003eConfirm Account Deletion\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n              \u003cp\u003eA confirmation dialog will appear. Tap \u003cstrong\u003eConfirm Delete\u003c/strong\u003e to finalize. Your session will immediately wipe and return you to the login screen.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n              \u003cspan class=\"step-badge\"\u003eStep 4: Confirmed \u0026amp; Logged Out\u003c/span\u003e\r\n            \u003c/div\u003e\r\n          \u003c/div\u003e\r\n        \u003c/div\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003c!-- Data Retention \u0026 Erasure Summary Table --\u003e\r\n        \u003cdiv class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top: 40px;\"\u003e\r\n          \u003ch3 style=\"margin-top: 0;\"\u003eData Retention \u0026amp; Erasure Summary\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n          \u003cp style=\"color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\r\n            In compliance with Google Play Developer Policies and data safety standards, here is how each category of data is handled upon deletion:\r\n          \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n          \u003cdiv class=\"data-table-wrapper\"\u003e\r\n            \u003ctable\u003e\r\n              \u003cthead\u003e\r\n                \u003ctr\u003e\r\n                  \u003cth\u003eData Category\u003c/th\u003e\r\n                  \u003cth\u003eExamples\u003c/th\u003e\r\n                  \u003cth\u003eAction Taken\u003c/th\u003e\r\n                \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n              \u003c/thead\u003e\r\n              \u003ctbody\u003e\r\n                \u003ctr\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSign-in Credentials\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003eFirebase Auth User ID, Email, Phone authentication state\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tag-deleted\"\u003eFirebase Auth account deleted\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n                \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n                \u003ctr\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDriver Profile\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003eFull name, selected city, working areas, ride app selection\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tag-deleted\"\u003eRemoved from /drivers/{uid}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n                \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n                \u003ctr\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVehicle Settings\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003eMake, model, variant, year, fuel average, petrol price\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tag-deleted\"\u003eRemoved from /drivers/{uid}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n                \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n                \u003ctr\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRate Configurations\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003eMinimum gross rate, target rate, multiplier, margin settings\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tag-deleted\"\u003eRemoved from /drivers/{uid}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n                \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n                \u003ctr\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCalculation History\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003eRecorded ride queries, extracted OCR fares, distance logs\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tag-deleted\"\u003eRemoved from /ride_calculations/{uid}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n                \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n                \u003ctr\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDevice \u0026amp; App Cache\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003eEncrypted SharedPreferences, temporary session tokens\u003c/td\u003e\r\n                  \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tag-deleted\"\u003eMust be cleared in the app\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n                \u003c/tr\u003e\r\n              \u003c/tbody\u003e\r\n            \u003c/table\u003e\r\n          \u003c/div\u003e\r\n        \u003c/div\u003e\r\n\r\n        \u003cdiv class=\"card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(145deg, #2d2049, #1b1433); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;\"\u003e\r\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\r\n            \u003ch3 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px;\"\u003eNeed Assistance?\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n            \u003cp style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\r\n              If you have uninstalled the app or cannot log in, email our support desk for manual removal.\r\n            \u003c/p\u003e\r\n          \u003c/div\u003e\r\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\r\n            \u003ca class=\"button secondary\" href=\"mailto:smartrideadvisor.support@gmail.com?subject=Manual%20Account%20Deletion%20Assistance\"\u003e\r\n              Email Developer\r\n            \u003c/a\u003e\r\n          \u003c/div\u003e\r\n        \u003c/div\u003e\r\n      \u003c/div\u003e\r\n    \u003c/section\u003e\r\n  \u003c/main\u003e\r\n\r\n  \u003cfooter\u003e\r\n    \u003cdiv class=\"container footer-content\"\u003e\r\n      \u003cdiv\u003e\r\n        \u003cstrong style=\"color: var(--text); font-size: 14px;\"\u003eSmart Ride Advisor\u003c/strong\u003e\r\n        \u003cp style=\"color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin: 4px 0 0;\"\u003e\r\n          Â© 2026 Muhammad Waqas Â· Independent app for ride-hailing drivers in Pakistan.\r\n        \u003c/p\u003e\r\n      \u003c/div\u003e\r\n      \u003cdiv class=\"footer-links\"\u003e\r\n        \u003ca href=\"index.html\"\u003eMain Website\u003c/a\u003e\r\n        \u003ca href=\"index.html#privacy\"\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e\r\n        \u003ca href=\"index.html#support\"\u003eHelp \u0026amp; Support\u003c/a\u003e\r\n      \u003c/div\u003e\r\n    \u003c/div\u003e\r\n  \u003c/footer\u003e\r\n"}
